      <title>Fearing ICE, Native Americans rush to prove their right to belong in the US</title>
      <link>https://rapidcityjournal.com/news/state-and-regional/article_8b7e6fc0-2109-5a6a-9c72-f7411b6296b4.html</link>
      <description>Many of the people whose ancestors lived in the U.S. thousands of years before Europeans are carrying tribal identification for protection against the Trump administration’s anti-immigration agenda. Dozens of the 575 federally recognized Native American tribes are making it easier…</description>
